{"ID":"20240206110727-b7e1x3d","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206110727-b7e1x3d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110727-b7e1x3d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110741-vrmhlg7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110730-dv167sc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110741-vrmhlg7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:244,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:244\u0026#125;","title":"海马","type":"doc","updated":"20240902101806"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110741-vrmhlg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110741-vrmhlg7","updated":"20240206110744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于广东、福建以及台湾沿海地区。\n【性状】\t线纹海马：呈扁长形而弯曲，体长约30cm。表面黄白色。头略似马头，有冠状突起，具管状长吻，口小，无牙，两眼深陷。躯干部七棱形，尾部四棱形，渐细卷曲，体上有瓦楞形的节纹并具短棘。体轻，骨质，坚硬。气微腥，味微咸。\n刺海马：体长1520cm。头部及体上环节间的棘细而尖。大海马：体长2030cm。黑褐色。\n三斑海马：体侧背部第1、4、7节的短棘基部各有1黑斑。\n小海马 (海蛆) ：体形小，长7"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10cm。黑褐色。节纹及短棘均较细小。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t温肾壮阳，散结消肿。用于阳痿，遗尿，肾虚作喘，症瘕积聚，跌扑损伤；外治痈肿疔疮。\n【注解】\t“马头”：指海马药材的头部略似马头。\n“瓦楞身”：指海马药材的体部具有纵棱，有瓦楞形的节纹和短棘。\n“蛇尾”：指药材海马的尾部渐细而向内卷曲，犹如蛇尾。\n【附注】\t海马 (所有品种) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》被列为易危物种。另外，它已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110730-dv167sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110730-dv167sc","updated":"20240206110730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110730-gegzbsb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716144457-4vgeh70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716144457-4vgeh70","updated":"20240716144457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海马 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海马 2-20240716144457-g4wz88d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716144410-tem5wl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716144410-tem5wl4","updated":"20240716144414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"线纹海马"}]},{"ID":"20240716144517-3wplhkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716144517-3wplhkn","updated":"20240716144852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海马 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海马 3-20240716144517-jt6jvje.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海马 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海马 4-20240716144852-o88ejlz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716151845-ubvoo6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716151845-ubvoo6c","updated":"20240716151848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大海马"}]},{"ID":"20240716152027-4rpah3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716152027-4rpah3d","updated":"20240716152244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties